{"id":"19f597e8b5469bbc","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-canonical-model.md","title":"Canonical Model","display":"df-canonical-model — Canonical Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-canonical-model","aliases":["88-df-canonical-model"],"display":"df-canonical-model — Canonical Model","depends_on":["[[88-df-structure]]","[[88-df-sentence]]","[[88-df-theory]]","[[88-df-satisfaction]]","[[88-df-consistent]]","[[88-df-provable]]","[[88-df-inference-rule]]","[[./88-df-term]]","[[88-df-closed-term]]","[[88-df-symbol]]","[[88-df-free-variable]]","[[88-df-substitution]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-canonical-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-canonical-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-canonical-model — Canonical Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3a560d130315ebdc\" href=\"?note=3a560d130315ebdc\" title=\"88-df-structure\">88-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"13ac48daafe6d04f\" href=\"?note=13ac48daafe6d04f\" title=\"88-df-sentence\">88-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"def3025c6c81c740\" href=\"?note=def3025c6c81c740\" title=\"88-df-theory\">88-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7d0aefc635fe57fc\" href=\"?note=7d0aefc635fe57fc\" title=\"88-df-satisfaction\">88-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b3bba05b63c0ebbf\" href=\"?note=b3bba05b63c0ebbf\" title=\"88-df-consistent\">88-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" href=\"?note=b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" title=\"88-df-provable\">88-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c7ab6c8e893872fb\" href=\"?note=c7ab6c8e893872fb\" title=\"88-df-inference-rule\">88-df-inference-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b768b53c62ab02de\" href=\"?note=b768b53c62ab02de\" title=\"./88-df-term\">88-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c5b1e64ccdf8eae8\" href=\"?note=c5b1e64ccdf8eae8\" title=\"88-df-closed-term\">88-df-closed-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0f1e525f3e037509\" href=\"?note=0f1e525f3e037509\" title=\"88-df-symbol\">88-df-symbol</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b642ab331635c77d\" href=\"?note=b642ab331635c77d\" title=\"88-df-free-variable\">88-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"a72f024d8daeb569\" href=\"?note=a72f024d8daeb569\" title=\"88-df-substitution\">88-df-substitution</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-canonical-model-—-Canonical-Model-$\\mathcal{M}_T$\">df-canonical-model — Canonical Model <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{M}_T\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,R\">\\(T,R\\)</span> (candidate theory and proof calculus)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTerm}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CTerm}_S\\)</span> (set of closed terms, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"c5b1e64ccdf8eae8\" href=\"?note=c5b1e64ccdf8eae8\" title=\"88-df-closed-term\">88-df-closed-term</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedTerm}_S(t)\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedTerm}_S(t)\\)</span> (closed-term predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\\)</span> (proof-rule predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MCHenkin}_{S,R}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{MCHenkin}_{S,R}(T)\\)</span> (maximally consistent, deductively closed Henkin predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\sim_{T,R}u\">\\(t\\sim_{T,R}u\\)</span> (provable-equality relation on closed terms)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TermCong}_{S,T,R}\">\\(\\mathrm{TermCong}_{S,T,R}\\)</span> (term-congruence predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\)</span> (candidate canonical term model)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CanModel}_{S,T,R}(\\mathfrak M)\">\\(\\mathrm{CanModel}_{S,T,R}(\\mathfrak M)\\)</span> (canonical-model predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>商类记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[t]\">\\([t]\\)</span> 的集合论解释由下式固定，所用关系始终是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim_{T,R}\">\\(\\sim_{T,R}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CTerm}_S\\coloneqq\n\\{t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S:\\mathrm{ClosedTerm}_S(t)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CTerm}_S\\coloneqq\n\\{t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S:\\mathrm{ClosedTerm}_S(t)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MCHenkin}_{S,R}(T)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\\land\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\\land\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\n(\\sigma\\in T\\leftrightarrow T\\vdash_R\\sigma)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\n(\\sigma\\in T\\lor\\neg\\sigma\\in T)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\n\\land(\\exists x\\,\\varphi)\\in T\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}\\to\n\\exists c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\;(\\varphi[c/x]\\in T)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MCHenkin}_{S,R}(T)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\\land\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\\land\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\n(\\sigma\\in T\\leftrightarrow T\\vdash_R\\sigma)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\n(\\sigma\\in T\\lor\\neg\\sigma\\in T)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\n\\land(\\exists x\\,\\varphi)\\in T\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}\\to\n\\exists c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\;(\\varphi[c/x]\\in T)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\nt\\sim_{T,R}u\n\\leftrightarrow\nt,u\\in\\mathrm{CTerm}_S\\land T\\vdash_R(t=u)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\nt\\sim_{T,R}u\n\\leftrightarrow\nt,u\\in\\mathrm{CTerm}_S\\land T\\vdash_R(t=u)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TermCong}_{S,T,R}\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{CTerm}_S\\;(t\\sim_{T,R}t)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall t,u\\in\\mathrm{CTerm}_S\\;\n(t\\sim_{T,R}u\\to u\\sim_{T,R}t)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall t,u,w\\in\\mathrm{CTerm}_S\\;\n(t\\sim_{T,R}u\\land u\\sim_{T,R}w\\to t\\sim_{T,R}w)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\;\n\\forall\\vec t,\\vec u\\in\\mathrm{CTerm}_S^n\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\forall i\\;(1\\leq i\\leq n\\to t_i\\sim_{T,R}u_i))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}\\to\nf(\\vec t)\\sim_{T,R}f(\\vec u)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall P\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\;\n\\forall\\vec t,\\vec u\\in\\mathrm{CTerm}_S^n\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\forall i\\;(1\\leq i\\leq n\\to t_i\\sim_{T,R}u_i))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\to\n(P(\\vec t)\\in T\\leftrightarrow P(\\vec u)\\in T)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TermCong}_{S,T,R}\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{CTerm}_S\\;(t\\sim_{T,R}t)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall t,u\\in\\mathrm{CTerm}_S\\;\n(t\\sim_{T,R}u\\to u\\sim_{T,R}t)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall t,u,w\\in\\mathrm{CTerm}_S\\;\n(t\\sim_{T,R}u\\land u\\sim_{T,R}w\\to t\\sim_{T,R}w)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\;\n\\forall\\vec t,\\vec u\\in\\mathrm{CTerm}_S^n\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\forall i\\;(1\\leq i\\leq n\\to t_i\\sim_{T,R}u_i))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}\\to\nf(\\vec t)\\sim_{T,R}f(\\vec u)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall P\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\;\n\\forall\\vec t,\\vec u\\in\\mathrm{CTerm}_S^n\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\forall i\\;(1\\leq i\\leq n\\to t_i\\sim_{T,R}u_i))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\to\n(P(\\vec t)\\in T\\leftrightarrow P(\\vec u)\\in T)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{CTerm}_S\\quad\n[t]\\coloneqq\\{u\\in\\mathrm{CTerm}_S:t\\sim_{T,R}u\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{CTerm}_S\\quad\n[t]\\coloneqq\\{u\\in\\mathrm{CTerm}_S:t\\sim_{T,R}u\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CanModel}_{S,T,R}(\\mathfrak M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{MCHenkin}_{S,R}(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{TermCong}_{S,T,R}\n\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak M)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak M)=\\mathrm{CTerm}_S/{\\sim_{T,R}}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\;\n(c^{\\mathfrak M}=[c]_{\\sim_{T,R}})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\;\n\\forall(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{CTerm}_S^n\\;\\Bigl(\nf^{\\mathfrak M}([t_1],\\ldots,[t_n])\n=[f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)]\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall P\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\;\\Bigl(\nP^{\\mathfrak M}=\\{([t_1],\\ldots,[t_n]):\n\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{CTerm}_S^n\\land P(\\vec t)\\in T\\}\\Bigr),\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CanModel}_{S,T,R}(\\mathfrak M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{MCHenkin}_{S,R}(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{TermCong}_{S,T,R}\n\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak M)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak M)=\\mathrm{CTerm}_S/{\\sim_{T,R}}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\;\n(c^{\\mathfrak M}=[c]_{\\sim_{T,R}})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\;\n\\forall(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{CTerm}_S^n\\;\\Bigl(\nf^{\\mathfrak M}([t_1],\\ldots,[t_n])\n=[f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)]\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall P\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\;\\Bigl(\nP^{\\mathfrak M}=\\{([t_1],\\ldots,[t_n]):\n\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{CTerm}_S^n\\land P(\\vec t)\\in T\\}\\Bigr),\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\)</span> : 最大一致 Henkin 理论<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>的闭项商模型</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TermCong}\">\\(\\mathrm{TermCong}\\)</span>显式承担商上的函数与关系解释代表元无关这一义务。</li>\n<li>真值引理<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\\models\\sigma\\leftrightarrow\\sigma\\in T\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\models\\sigma\\leftrightarrow\\sigma\\in T\\)</span>需要对公式\n结构归纳证明；它是后续定理，而不是典范模型“定义”的一个分句。</li>\n<li>完备性定理证明的核心技术 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"2f3ef5718562a673\" href=\"?note=2f3ef5718562a673\" title=\"88-thm-completeness\">88-thm-completeness</a>)</li>\n<li>用于证明：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi \\models \\varphi \\rightarrow \\Phi \\vdash_R \\varphi\">\\(\\Phi \\models \\varphi \\rightarrow \\Phi \\vdash_R \\varphi\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"2f3ef5718562a673\" href=\"?note=2f3ef5718562a673\" title=\"88-thm-completeness\">88-thm-completeness</a> — 完备性定理</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"b3bba05b63c0ebbf\" href=\"?note=b3bba05b63c0ebbf\" title=\"88-df-consistent\">88-df-consistent</a> — 一致性</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"7d0aefc635fe57fc\" href=\"?note=7d0aefc635fe57fc\" title=\"88-df-satisfaction\">88-df-satisfaction</a> — 满足关系</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-canonical-model-—-Canonical-Model-$\\mathcal{M}_T$","text":"df-canonical-model — Canonical Model $\\mathcal{M}_T$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-structure","status":"resolved","i